<p>Events are fetched only when requested and are not stored as reports or passed to AI/MCP. A shared calendar selected through several accounts is displayed once. No invitations are sent and no Google events are changed.</p></section>
<section id="reports" class="pub-card"><h2>Audience, search & video performance</h2><p>Use the same dates for comparisons. Search Console ends at least three days ago. Each report includes a graph and exact figures. Readership, search clicks and video views remain separate measurements.</p><form method="post" class="google-inline"><?=csrf_field()?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="report"><label>Report<select name="report"><?php foreach(google_workspace_reports()as$key=>$spec):?><option value="<?=e($key)?>"><?=e($spec[0].' · '.$spec[3])?></option><?php endforeach;?></select></label><label>From<input type="date" name="start" value="<?=e(gmdate('Y-m-d',strtotime('-30 days')))?>" required></label><label>Through<input type="date" name="end" value="<?=e(gmdate('Y-m-d',strtotime('-3 days')))?>" required></label><label class="google-check"><input type="checkbox" name="compare" value="1"> Compare with the previous period</label><button class="wbtn primary">Read report</button></form>
<form method="post" action="<?=url('/write/connections/google_youtube_analytics/start')?>"><?=csrf_field()?><button class="wbtn">Connect YouTube Analytics</button></form><p>Watch time and period trends require their own read-only grant, separate from channel totals and uploading.</p></section>
